bams23	CGGTCTGTCTCTATTATTCAGTGGT	CCTGTTGCTCCTAGTGATTTCTTAC	401-1101
bams24	CTTCTACTTCCGTACTTGAAATTGG	CGTCACGTACCATTTAATGTTGTTA	345-1045
bams25	CCGAATACGTAAGAAATAAATCCAC	TGAAAGATCTTGAAAAACAAGCATT	141-841
bams28	CTCTGTTGTAACAAAATTTCCGTCT	TATTAAACCAGGCGTTACTTACAGC	243-943
